Adds four running-total perf counters the title's host code feeds in every configuration (world update time and
count, host frame limiter wait, guest GPU fence wait) and shows them per swap on the Performance line. They add
GUEST / GAME THREAD LIMITED: the command processor idles a quarter of the frame, neither side waits and the world
update alone takes a quarter of the frame.

